flowchart TD
    %% User Interactions
    User[User] -->|Access UI| Frontend[Frontend (React/Angular)]
    Frontend -->|API Requests| Gateway[API Gateway]

    %% Authentication & Authorization
    Gateway -->|Validate Token| AuthService[Auth Service (OAuth2)]
    AuthService -->|Issue JWT Token| User[User]
    AuthService -->|Validate Token| ServiceA
    AuthService -->|Validate Token| ServiceB
    AuthService -->|Validate Token| ServiceC

    %% Services & Secure Communication
    Gateway -->|Route Request| ServiceA[Service A]
    Gateway -->|Route Request| ServiceB[Service B]
    Gateway -->|Route Request| ServiceC[Service C]
    ServiceA -->|mTLS| ServiceB
    ServiceB -->|mTLS| ServiceC
    
    %% Data Security
    ServiceA -->|Encrypted Data| DatabaseA[(Database A)]
    ServiceB -->|Encrypted Data| DatabaseB[(Database B)]
    ServiceC -->|Access Secrets| SecretsManager[Secrets Manager]

    %% Monitoring & Threat Protection
    ServiceA -->|Log Events| LogAggregator[Log Aggregation (ELK Stack)]
    ServiceB -->|Log Events| LogAggregator
    ServiceC -->|Log Events| LogAggregator
    Gateway -->|Monitor Traffic| WAF[Web Application Firewall]
    WAF -->|Detect Threats| ThreatDetection[Intrusion Detection System (IDS)]

    %% External Integrations
    ServiceC -->|Secure API Call| ThirdPartyAPI[Third-Party API]
    ThirdPartyAPI -->|Response| ServiceC
